{"5055790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Wizard Disaster", "steam_appid": 5055790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5090820], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wizard Disaster is a cartoon boss rush and nothing else. No corridors, no fetch quests, no filler between the fights. Every location on the map is a boss. The whole map is open from the start, and there are <strong>twelve bosses between you and the end of the game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple enough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unfortunately, they are very good at their jobs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5055790/extras/f30c4ae0cd8c29b0f2f1363b7f5de72f.avif?t=1787758781\" width=616 height=92 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5055790/extras/6919d087ce6375c031c483b2a5624e4b.avif?t=1787758781\" width=616 height=126 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are <strong>twelve bosses</strong>, and most of them won't be what you expect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5055790/extras/4575ecfbc4b85bdd29658574ff2ad388.poster.avif?t=1787758781\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5055790/extras/4575ecfbc4b85bdd29658574ff2ad388.webm?t=1787758781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5055790/extras/4575ecfbc4b85bdd29658574ff2ad388.mp4?t=1787758781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nothing here is unfair.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5055790/extras/5e6128af0163bcb758a9e9a13820efb2.poster.avif?t=1787758781\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5055790/extras/5e6128af0163bcb758a9e9a13820efb2.webm?t=1787758781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5055790/extras/5e6128af0163bcb758a9e9a13820efb2.mp4?t=1787758781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing here is forgiving, either.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5055790/extras/ceee8b4ce3223933b66705b5667ce1e2.poster.avif?t=1787758781\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5055790/extras/ceee8b4ce3223933b66705b5667ce1e2.webm?t=1787758781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5055790/extras/ceee8b4ce3223933b66705b5667ce1e2.mp4?t=1787758781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight them in whatever order you want, or whatever order you can survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5055790/extras/e1e0c4ecff94f03539832cd63951cefa.poster.avif?t=1787758781\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5055790/extras/e1e0c4ecff94f03539832cd63951cefa.webm?t=1787758781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5055790/extras/e1e0c4ecff94f03539832cd63951cefa.mp4?t=1787758781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5055790/extras/cf212ab11205263303d61cb76cecf02c.poster.avif?t=1787758781\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5055790/extras/cf212ab11205263303d61cb76cecf02c.webm?t=1787758781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5055790/extras/cf212ab11205263303d61cb76cecf02c.mp4?t=1787758781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have <strong>three hearts</strong>. That's your entire health budget. Want a fourth? It'll cost you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start with one spell and a pair of boots. Everything else has to be earned and bought:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New ways to attack</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Better ways to move</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A few tricks to keep in reserve when everything goes wrong</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5055790/extras/05bca6b2347d9cab2ed43af4173ed6c8.avif?t=1787758781\" width=616 height=92 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5055790/extras/aea4b42391e742afcac8016a7744d34c.avif?t=1787758781\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every boss rewards you with a medal. <strong>Bronze</strong> for beating them, <strong>Silver</strong> for doing it without taking more than one hit, and <strong>Gold</strong> for a clean run under par.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Medals earn you coin, and coins buy upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5055790/extras/2f0171e47a609451bfc4391823b6eacd.poster.avif?t=1787758781\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5055790/extras/2f0171e47a609451bfc4391823b6eacd.webm?t=1787758781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5055790/extras/2f0171e47a609451bfc4391823b6eacd.mp4?t=1787758781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So going back to a boss you've already beaten isn't just replaying old fights for the sake of it. It's how you earn the upgrades that might finally get you through the next one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full keyboard and controller support, both rebindable. Three save slots.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wizard Disaster is a cartoon boss rush and nothing else. No corridors, no fetch quests, no filler between the fights. Every location on the map is a boss. The whole map is open from the start, and there are <strong>twelve bosses between you and the end of the game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple enough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unfortunately, they are very good at their jobs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5055790/extras/f30c4ae0cd8c29b0f2f1363b7f5de72f.avif?t=1787758781\" width=616 height=92 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5055790/extras/6919d087ce6375c031c483b2a5624e4b.avif?t=1787758781\" width=616 height=126 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are <strong>twelve bosses</strong>, and most of them won't be what you expect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5055790/extras/4575ecfbc4b85bdd29658574ff2ad388.poster.avif?t=1787758781\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5055790/extras/4575ecfbc4b85bdd29658574ff2ad388.webm?t=1787758781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5055790/extras/4575ecfbc4b85bdd29658574ff2ad388.mp4?t=1787758781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nothing here is unfair.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5055790/extras/5e6128af0163bcb758a9e9a13820efb2.poster.avif?t=1787758781\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5055790/extras/5e6128af0163bcb758a9e9a13820efb2.webm?t=1787758781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5055790/extras/5e6128af0163bcb758a9e9a13820efb2.mp4?t=1787758781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing here is forgiving, either.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamsta