ve <strong>three hearts</strong>. That's your entire health budget. Want a fourth? It'll cost you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start with one spell and a pair of boots. Everything else has to be earned and bought:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New ways to attack</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Better ways to move</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A few tricks to keep in reserve when everything goes wrong</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5055790/extras/05bca6b2347d9cab2ed43af4173ed6c8.avif?t=1787758781\" width=616 height=92 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5055790/extras/aea4b42391e742afcac8016a7744d34c.avif?t=1787758781\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every boss rewards you with a medal. <strong>Bronze</strong> for beating them, <strong>Silver</strong> for doing it without taking more than one hit, and <strong>Gold</strong> for a clean run under par.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Medals earn you coin, and coins buy upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5055790/extras/2f0171e47a609451bfc4391823b6eacd.poster.avif?t=1787758781\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5055790/extras/2f0171e47a609451bfc4391823b6eacd.webm?t=1787758781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5055790/extras/2f0171e47a609451bfc4391823b6eacd.mp4?t=1787758781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So going back to a boss you've already beaten isn't just replaying old fights for the sake of it. It's how you earn the upgrades that might finally get you through the next one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full keyboard and controller support, both rebindable. Three save slots.</p>", "short_description": "A boss-rush adventure through a cartoon wizard universe. Twelve bosses, three spells, and nothing in between them but the next fight. Beat them, take their seals, and finish the banishment you fumbled the first time.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5055790/2b3bb2f13fc95ea07b0c748f0c65ba5d3f95ee5e/header.jpg?t=1787758781", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5055790/0a784918042ab09441f54f11217a695eea5f3ae6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787758781", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5055790/0a784918042ab09441f54f11217a695eea5f3ae6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787758781", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual-core 2.0 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3.3 compatible GPU with 1 GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any Windows-compatible audio device<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> No</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Quad-core 2.5 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Mem